              <div class="faq-list">
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What types of industrial equipment do you offer?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">We feature equipment categories such as material handling systems, lifting equipment, conveyor solutions, and industrial machinery. Availability depends on the products offered.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What engineering services can I explore?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Explore engineering and design, manufacturing and assembly, installation and commissioning, and ongoing maintenance support, each planned around your application.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Can I request a solution for my specific project?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. Share your application, site conditions, and goals, and the team will review your requirements before recommending a practical direction.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">How do I request a quote for equipment?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Use the contact form with your equipment needs, quantities, and timeline. The team will follow up to clarify details and prepare a quote.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Do you support equipment installation and integration?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. We help plan site preparation, installation steps, and commissioning checks so new equipment works with your existing systems.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Can I get maintenance support for industrial equipment?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. We can help plan preventive maintenance, troubleshoot issues, and coordinate parts to keep your equipment reliable over time.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
